oiler":false,"text":"Rin is a loner who also has a sharp tongue. At the same time, deep down she can be quite immature and just wants to be spoiled by others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her hobbies and special skills are studying. Her parents have high expectations of her and she gets excellent grades, but perhaps because of that, she cannot understand people who can't do the same. She refuses to listen to people who aren't either as talented as her or on good terms with her, and because of that, she has frequently gotten into trouble with teachers and other adults."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After acknowledging Haruto's credibility and upon realizing he wasn't a bad guy, she refused to be honest around him because she didn't want to look like an easy woman before yielding."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125703"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"皮肉屋で一匹狼と見た目通り……かと思えば、認めた相手には甘えまくる子供っぽさもあり、一度内面を知ればとてもからかい甲斐のある娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味と特技は勉強。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親から与えられた厳しい教育も楽々こなしてきたが、そのせいか、できない人の気持ちに鈍感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人だろうが自分よりできない人間の言うことは聞かず、歴代管理人の悩みの種になっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"春人の能力を認めてから素直になると思いきや、軽い女ではないアピールのため一度は渋るが結局言うことを聞く。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24740","sourceWorkId":"34204","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"皮肉屋で一匹狼と見た目通り……かと思えば、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"認めた相手には甘えまくる子供っぽさもあり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一度内面を知ればとてもからかい甲斐のある娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味と特技は勉強。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親から与えられた厳しい教育も楽々こなしてきたが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのせいか、できない人の気持ちに鈍感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「べ、別に貴方を喜ばせたいわけではないので、気持ち悪いニヤニヤ顔は止めてもらって良いですか？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"132454"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"所属","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"132454","value":"櫻葉女子学院2年"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"height":[{"comparisonValue":"165","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125703","value":"165"},{"comparisonValue":"165","scope":"sourceWork","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24740","sourceWorkId":"34204","value":"165"},{"comparisonValue":"163","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"132454","value":"163cm"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/feb6fe23a44f0d2c369cf3816634afd6ffa22665ba19c9efc2fb46f023f5b459.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/6620fad873e8d03bc606e692c74b9124bce10ff5d78944f5e1cb3ade713bb0cc.webp","width":79,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井浩美","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:460747:132454:4956:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c125704","characterName":"秋島 ひより","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"132455","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"431364"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24741"],"vndbCharacterId":"c125704"},"originalCharacterName":"秋島 ひより","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"915"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she looks quite punkish, in reality Hiyori is a selfish girl who tends to get lonely easily. She often breaks the curfew and likes pranking others. Hiyori is actually a talented painter who, however, only sees her talent as a nuisance and uses it for only decorating her room."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is constantly treated as a problem child who does nothing but mess around and cause trouble to everyone around her. After being scolded by Haruto, she becomes a bit more obedient, but still enjoys teasing him as she wants him to take care of her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her weakness is being whispered to."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125704"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"パンクな見た目通りのギャル、かと思いきや、ただの寂しがり屋の我儘娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"門限破りも悪戯もその真意を知れば可愛いもの、のはず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実際、美術系への造詣はあるものの、本人には無用の長物らしく部屋の彩に使われる程度。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"放任主義な両親の下で育ったためか愛情に飢えており、誰彼構わず遊ぼうとばかりに悪戯を仕掛ける問題児扱い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一度春人にこっぴどく叱られてからは割と素直になるが、結局、構ってほしさに困らせては楽しんでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24741","sourceWorkId":"34204","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"パンクな見た目通りのギャル、かと思いきや、ただの寂しがり屋の我儘娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"門限破りも悪戯もその真意を知れば可愛いもの、のはず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実際、美術系への造詣はあるものの、本人には無用の長物らしく部屋の彩に使われる程度。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"放任主義な両親の下で育ったためか愛情に飢えており、誰彼構わず遊ぼうとばかりに悪戯を仕掛ける問題児扱い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一度春人にこっぴどく叱られてからは割と素直になるが、結局、構ってほしさに困らせては楽しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「にひひ。だーいじょうぶですよっ！ひより嘘つきませんから♪」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"132455"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"所属","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"132455","value":"櫻葉女子学院2年"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/2503549164a086be0ec9a854feee7d1666a1bfe891cf06bcb91823667b1d7211.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/269d98fbd78e838a0cde926187beeeddc7a1fac8f7c61415ba3ec8f2608ebc1f.webp","width":87,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"空賀花","creatorId":"vndb:s15476","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15476","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15476","name":"空賀 花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:460747:132455:34089:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c125705","characterName":"冬咲 藍子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"132456","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"431364"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24742"],"vndbCharacterId":"c125705"},"originalCharacterName":"冬咲 藍子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"124"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"91"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who has a gentle appearance. Due to her naive nature Aiko isn't good at doubting people, and as such, the people around her are protective of her. In addition to this, she is a bit of a romantic, as she dreamt of meeting her destined prince after entering the academy due to the shoujo mangas she has read."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As such, when Haruto starts working at the dormitory, she feels like she's finally met her dream man. Initially she was quite frustrated as she felt like she hadn't managed to charm him. But then all of a sudden, their relationship deepens...?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125705"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しげな見た目そのままで少し世間知らず。人を疑うといったことを知らなさそうな雰囲気から非常に庇護欲をかき立てているとかなんとか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院に入学後、これまで触れてこなかった少女漫画にハマった影響か、運命の王子様との出会いがあるかもと待ち続けるメルヘンな一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その結果、突然現れた春人に対して一目惚れに近い感情を抱くもののなかなかうまくアピールすることができず悶々とした日々を過ごす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、ひょんなことから関係性が一気に進展してしまって……？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24742","sourceWorkId":"34204","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しげな見た目そのままで少し世間知らず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人を疑うといったことを知らなさそうな雰囲気から非常に庇護欲をかき立てているとかなんとか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院に入学後、これまで触れてこなかった少女漫画にハマった影響か、運命の王子様との出会いがあるかもと待ち続けるメルヘンな一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その結果、突然現れた春人に対して一目惚れに近い感情を抱くもののなかなかうまくアピールすることができず悶々とした日々を過ごす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、ひょんなことから関係性が一気に進展してしまって……？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「だ、大丈夫です！隠す事なんてないですっ、何でも聞いてください！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"132456"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"所属","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"132456","value":"櫻葉女子学院2年"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c871d0f4ddce7243695cdade491f497823614eb7ed620b13e63f0e7358d2af7e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6eae485cb89947750b6c0572571be8ed9c726a97d1b3ed2daffe88132a0cf09e.webp","width":85,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本理絵","creatorId":"vndb:s874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s874","name":"岡本 理絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:460747:132456:13368:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c125706","characterName":"北上 春人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c125706"},"originalCharacterName":"北上 春人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of this game."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125706"}],"profileFacts":[],"metada